Column name: userId Type: TEXT Description: This field is deprecated. Use `totals.totalTransactionRevenue` instead.
Column name: trafficSource Type: VARIANT Description: The number of sessions (for convenience). This value is 1 for sessions with interaction events. The value is null if there are no interaction events in the session.
Column name: visitId Type: NUMBER Description: An identifier for this session. This is part of the value usually stored as the _utmb cookie. This is only unique to the user. For a completely unique ID, you should use a combination of `fullVisitorId` and `visitId`.
Column name: socialEngagementType Type: TEXT Description: Total number of screenviews within the session.
Column name: visitNumber Type: NUMBER Description: The session number for this user. If this is the first session, then this is set to 1.
Column name: totals Type: VARIANT Description: This section contains aggregate values across the session.
Column name: visitStartTime Type: NUMBER Description: The timestamp (expressed as POSIX time).
Column name: fullVisitorId Type: TEXT Description: Total number of ecommerce transactions within the session.
Column name: device Type: VARIANT Description: Total number of hits within the session.
Column name: visitorId Type: NUMBER Description: This field is deprecated. Use `fullVisitorId` instead.
Column name: channelGrouping Type: TEXT Description: Total number of new users in session (for convenience). If this is the first visit, this value is 1, otherwise it is null.
Column name: date Type: TEXT Description: The date of the session in YYYYMMDD format.
Column name: geoNetwork Type: VARIANT Description: Total number of pageviews within the session.
Column name: hits Type: VARIANT Description: Total bounces (for convenience). For a bounced session, the value is 1, otherwise it is null.
